{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">播映長達九年半的《愛·回家之開心速遞》即將劃下句點，大批忠實觀眾與一眾演員皆對此感到極度不捨。在9日播出的第 2847 集「得放手時需放手」中，劇情上演了極具催淚效果的溫情戲碼，戲裡戲外的離別氛圍，引起網民熱烈討論。</p><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><p id=\"p-rc_939755ac3148b01a-391\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">該集最動人的高潮位，莫過於若水與父親樹根的一番肺腑之言。當樹根驚訝於若水為了家庭與腹中胎兒變得懂事時，若水握著父親的手深情剖白：「你額頭慢慢慢慢愈嚟愈多皺紋嘅時候，我就慢慢慢慢識諗啦。爸，我知你錫我，但我大個啦，好多嘢你要讓我自己面對返。我知你養兒一百歲，常憂九十九，但其實唔應該㗎！爸，你辛苦咗咁耐，照顧咗我哋咁多年，是時候放手，讓我哋自己去跑去闖，你係時候享福啦。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_939755ac3148b01a-393\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">此幕鏡頭巧妙地將童年若水的小演員與呂慧儀本人交替切換，寓意時光荏苒，觸動無數父母心，引起極大共鳴。</p><p id=\"p-rc_939755ac3148b01a-393\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f167e6f9-e7d1-446c-a059-77d8f6bf2a1f.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026gUQKL0RUEF1783675150.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f167e6f9-e7d1-446c-a059-77d8f6bf2a1f.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><p id=\"p-rc_939755ac3148b01a-394\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">戲外，飾演「龔燁」的張景淳亦難掩不捨之情：<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">「無論係家人或愛你嘅人刻意做多咗，擾亂咗你原來嘅plan、做咗豬隊友… 定係純粹太多關心令做阿仔阿囡嘅覺得煩都好…搞到最後可能變咗有『額外的少少手尾』要替對方的過份關愛行為收拾…..雖然的確添了麻煩，but如果係pure嘅愛….喺解決問題後都要acknowledge返嘅。畢竟，人越大，真心愛自己關心自己嘅人會越嚟越難搵，或佢地雖然存在但彼此越嚟越難有時間/機會交集。因此見到面時，有愛的話真係要說出來，表現出來。係絕對Worth過程中不小心做多咗講多咗而帶來嘅少少麻煩的。」</span><br/></p><p id=\"p-rc_939755ac3148b01a-394\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9e9c1e92-c17a-496a-a86c-b1177a031e51.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026h2eBYY0BtO1783675242.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9e9c1e92-c17a-496a-a86c-b1177a031e51.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><p id=\"p-rc_939755ac3148b01a-396\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">他指：<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">「btw臨近劇集拍攝最後最後的日子，我今天也經歷了一份很正能量的motivation，appreciate人與人之間以正能量和真心互相傳動的『加油』。希望（開心速遞）最後的日子裡面，我們也能給大家最好的能量，一齊和觀眾celebrate呢齣處境劇的畢業❤️」</span><br/></p><p id=\"p-rc_939755ac3148b01a-396\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">《愛回家之開心速遞》鐵粉問答比賽﹕</span><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://tvb.app.do/quiz_chl\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">https://tvb.app.do/quiz_chl</span></a><br/></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-14T04:18:45.361925+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":785,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}